<span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">累计已回购金额显示为“8416.79亿”</span></span></span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">，而其此前预计回购的金额总计才1-2亿。显然是</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">将已回购金额的单位“元”误写成了“万元”。</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 122, 170)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">但一字之差，金额却差了8400多亿。</span></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);caret-color:rgb(255, 0, 0);clear:both;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);cursor:text;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:2em;margin:0px 8px;max-inline-size:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.544px\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Oj_mSguGdAozIOK3AFkCwgqq-9NQ_AkBj4gBgZ7DvucOcAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Oj_mSguGdAozIOK3AFkCwgqq-9NQ_AkBj4gBgZ7DvucOcAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:637px;height:100%\"/></span></span></span></span></p></section><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">5日一早，华安证券紧急发布修订版公告，将上述单位修正为“元”。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);caret-color:rgb(255, 0, 0);clear:both;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);cursor:text;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:2em;margin:0px 8px;max-inline-size:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.544px\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OlOjWl7ULqC7UpFMer76UfDw_qkSsbneYAU1q7ZDi-abwAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OlOjWl7ULqC7UpFMer76UfDw_qkSsbneYAU1q7ZDi-abwAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:635px;height:100%\"/></span></span></span></span></p></section><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">今年以来，券商业绩普遍预喜。华安证券此前披露公告显示，预计2026年上半年归母净利润20.7亿元至22.77亿元，同比增长100%-120%；扣非净利润预计20.57亿元至22.63亿元，同比增长100%-120%。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">公开资料显示，华安证券成立于2001年1月8日，是安徽省属国有控股的综合性证券公司，于2016年12月上交所上市。截至发稿，华安证券股价上涨5.55%，报8.18元每股，市值近410.98亿元。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:2em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:8px;margin-right:8px;margin-top:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(62, 62, 62)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);caret-color:rgb(255, 0, 0);clear:both;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);cursor:text;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weig